# SSL Rules (2)
## 16. HTTPS Everywhere
HTTP redirects to HTTPS. HSTS on. No mixed content.

## 17. No Extra Certs
No additional certs unless client needs them.

# Monitoring Rules (3)
## 36. HetrixTools Uptime
Uptime monitoring from launch. Define alert recipients and response SLA.

## 37. Strix Scan
Run before launch, after big changes, every few months.

## 38. Deploy Alerts
Vercel notifications to team Slack.

# Automated Checks (3)
## 39. SEO Check Script
npm run seo:check validates titles, H1s, descriptions, canonicals, alt text, schema.

## 40. Links Check Script
npm run links:check finds 404s, broken links, staging URLs.

## 41. CI Integration
Run both checks on PR to main.

# Blog (1)
## 48. Common Blog Template
/blog index and /blog/[slug] detail. Same structure every site.

# DNS Rules (4)
## 49. DNS Backup
Save zone export before changes.

## 50. Cloudflare DNS
Copy all records. Point apex + www to Vercel.

## 51. Test After Switch
301 redirects tested. Email delivery tested.

## 52. Keep Old Hosting
Keep active 48 hours for rollback. Track domain expiry.

# Speed Rules (4)
## 64. Prerender Default
Astro prefetch enabled. Static where possible.

## 65. Form UX
Loading state on submit. No double-submit.

## 66. Real Device Testing
Throttled mobile. Lighthouse mobile > 90. Core Web Vitals pass.

## 67. Sitemap Caching
s-maxage=300, stale-while-revalidate.
